{"_id":"L5RCoreTec000037","name":"Incite Haunting","permission":{"default":0},"type":"technique","data":{"in_curriculum":false,"xp_used":0,"rank":"1","bought_at_rank":0,"ring":"void","technique_type":"maho","effects":"If you succeed, you curse your target, causing them to suffer the Afflicted condition.\nIf you fail, the target rebuffs your efforts. If your shortfall is 2 or higher, the target also becomes aware of your attempted malediction.","xp_cost":"3","description":"","book_reference":"Core p.224"},"sort":100001,"flags":{},"img":"systems/l5r5e/assets/icons/items/technique.svg","effects":[]}
{"_id":"L5RCoreTec000038","name":"Grip of Anguish","permission":{"default":0},"type":"technique","data":{"in_curriculum":false,"xp_used":0,"rank":"1","bought_at_rank":0,"ring":"void","technique_type":"maho","effects":"If you succeed, you curse your target, causing them to suffer supernatural damage equal to your Water Ring plus the number of your rings with a Shadowlands Taint disadvantage attached.","xp_cost":"3","description":"","book_reference":"Core p.224"},"sort":100001,"flags":{},"img":"systems/l5r5e/assets/icons/items/technique.svg","effects":[]}
{"_id":"L5RCoreTec000039","name":"Unholy Fervor","permission":{"default":0},"type":"technique","data":{"in_curriculum":false,"xp_used":0,"rank":"1","bought_at_rank":0,"ring":"void","technique_type":"maho","effects":"If you succeed, you curse the target with blinding fury; they suffer the Enraged condition.\nIf you succeed, you augment the target's corruption; they may treat each of their Shadowlands Taint disadvantages as an advantage that apply to any checks using its ring. This effect persists until the end of the scene.","xp_cost":"3","description":"","book_reference":"Core p.225"},"sort":100001,"flags":{},"img":"systems/l5r5e/assets/icons/items/technique.svg","effects":[]}
{"_id":"L5RCoreTec000040","name":"Mark of Desecration","permission":{"default":0},"type":"technique","data":{"in_curriculum":false,"xp_used":0,"rank":"1","bought_at_rank":0,"ring":"void","technique_type":"maho","effects":"If you succeed, you summon a Zombie Peasant (see page 321) from each target.\nIf you succeed, you curse an area encompassing 1 range band around each target’s position, which gains the Defiled terrain quality (see page 267).","xp_cost":"3","description":"","book_reference":"Core p.225"},"sort":100001,"flags":{},"img":"systems/l5r5e/assets/icons/items/technique.svg","effects":[]}
{"_id":"L5RCoreTec000041","name":"Sinful Whispers","permission":{"default":0},"type":"technique","data":{"in_curriculum":false,"xp_used":0,"rank":"1","bought_at_rank":0,"ring":"void","technique_type":"maho","effects":"If you succeed, you curse your target, sapping their will; they must answer your questions honestly (and find doing so unremarkable at the time). This effect persists for a number of rounds equal to your Air Ring.","xp_cost":"3","description":"","book_reference":"Core p.225"},"sort":100001,"flags":{},"img":"systems/l5r5e/assets/icons/items/technique.svg","effects":[]}